{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2moggf7n","type":"work","title":"古今詞話","authors":[{"name":"沈雄","role":"纂","dynasty":"清","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bn6r"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《古今詞話》•六卷","author_info":"國朝沈雄纂","summary":"國朝沈雄纂。雄字偶僧，吳江人。是編所述，上起於唐，下迄康熙中年。雜引舊文，參以近人之論，亦間附己說。分詞評、詞辨、詞品三門，徵引頗為寒儉。又多不著出典。所引近人之說，尤多標榜，不為定論。","edition":"浙江巡撫采進本"},{"source":"清史稿藝文志","source_bid":"d59f2mp0flz4","title_info":"古今詞話","summary":"古今詞話六卷。沈雄撰。"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《古今詞話》八卷","author_info":"(清)沈雄撰","summary":"《古今詞話》八卷。(清)沈雄撰。影印湖南省圖書館藏清康熙澄暉堂刻本。","edition":"影印湖南省圖書館藏清康熙澄暉堂刻本","volume":"第1733冊","section":"集部 集部"}],"juan_count":{"number":6},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-kangxichenghuitangke","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02110704","metadata":{"edition":"康熙澄暉堂刻本","version":"v11","total_page":743,"paragraph_count":918,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02110704.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC1733%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":1733},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%8A%E8%A9%9E%E8%A9%B1%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":6}],"measure_info":"六卷","updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:40:18+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"qing","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「清」","dynasty":"清","dynasty_basis":"qing_round1:period=qing 且非通用作者 dynasty 唯一为「清」","description":{"text":"沈雄（清）纂。六卷；諸志所著之數有異，別作八卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》《清史稿藝文志》《續修四庫全書》。《續修四庫全書》列於集部 集部。《欽定四庫全書總目》清乾隆間館臣修；《清史稿藝文志》民國趙爾巽等修——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["欽定四庫全書總目","清史稿藝文志","續修四庫全書"]},"ai_note":"2026-08-24 J11 description